%SIXMD 1
# @?MKFS.DTFS - CREATE A NATIVE DEC@TAPE FILESYSTEM

## @?OPTIONS

### @?-O TYPE
SELECT NATIVE, TENEX, OR ITS DIRECTORY FORMAT.  RO MAY BE COMBINED WITH THE
TYPE; RW IS NOT VALID WHILE CREATING THE INITIAL DIRECTORY.

## @?OPERANDS

### @?/DEV/DTC0
CURRENT DECTAPE DEVICE TO INITIALIZE.

## DESCRIPTION

MKFS.DTFS WRITES A FRESH EMPTY DIRECTORY IN THE SELECTED SUPPORTED DTFS
PERSONALITY.  THE CURRENT COMMAND OPERATES ON DTC0.
USAGE IS 'MKFS.DTFS -O TYPE /DEV/DTC0'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
